n    <!-- Left Page -->\n    <div class=\"page\">\n      <div class=\"left-header-small\">AI 超级个体 · 粉丝寄语</div>\n      <h1 class=\"left-title\">AI时代<br><span>普通人如何逆袭?</span></h1>\n      <div class=\"left-subtitle\">超级个体铁三角 × 人字型商业模式</div>\n      <div class=\"left-subtitle-2\">从“打工者”进化为“一人企业 OPC”</div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <div class=\"circle-num\">1</div>\n        <div>正在发生的革新</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"s1-boxes\">\n        <div class=\"s1-box orange\">\n          <div class=\"s1-box-title\">发号施令的人</div>\n          <div>懂得用 AI 驾驭工具，放大自我能力</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"s1-box gray\">\n          <div class=\"s1-box-title\">听命行事的人</div>\n          <div>被 AI 替代重复性劳动，沦为平庸</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"s1-footer\">写文章：3小时→3分钟 | 开发系统：3万元→3小时 | 一个人→一支队伍</div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <div class=\"circle-num\">2</div>\n        <div>超级个体铁三角</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"s2-container\">\n        <div class=\"s2-title\">多维竞争力 = 瑞士军刀型人才</div>\n        <div class=\"s2-cols\">\n          <div class=\"s2-col\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-placeholder\">[Icon]</div>\n            <strong>AI 工具</strong>\n            <span>左手武器</span>\n            <span>十倍提效</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"s2-col\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-placeholder\">[Icon]</div>\n            <strong>自我管理</strong>\n            <span>大脑内核</span>\n            <span>掌控时间/财富</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"s2-col\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-placeholder\">[Icon]</div>\n            <strong>自媒体 IP</strong>\n            <span>右手扩音器</span>\n            <span>连接用户变现</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <div class=\"circle-num\">3</div>\n        <div>人字型商业闭环</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"s3-subtitle\">从“挑水”到“修管道”——打造被动收入</div>\n      <div class=\"s3-orange-box\">\n        <div class=\"s3-col\">\n          <div class=\"s3-col-title\">➔ 左边一撇·能力与流量</div>\n          <div class=\"s3-col-subtitle\">当下的饭碗·生存底座</div>\n          <ul class=\"s3-list\">\n            <li>AI 提效 + 飞书系统</li>\n            <li>小红书基本玩法 + 个人 IP</li>\n            <li>全域社群联盟赋能</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"s3-col\">\n          <div class=\"s3-col-title\">➔ 右边一捺·供应链与管道</div>\n          <div class=\"s3-col-subtitle\">未来的保障·永续资产</div>\n          <ul class=\"s3-list\">\n            <li>全球顶尖大健康供应链</li>\n            <li>护肝计划 / 体重管理 / 古法养生</li>\n            <li>营养早餐 / 身心疗愈</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"s3-footer\">顶天立地 = 左手流量变现 + 右手健康管道 = 家族资产</div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <div class=\"circle-num\">4</div>\n        <div>超级个体四步修炼</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"s4-grid\">\n        <div class=\"s4-box\">\n          <div class=\"s4-box-title\"><span class=\"icon\">1</span> 装备库</div>\n          <div class=\"s4-box-text\">AI工具评测·飞书自动化模版</div>\n          <div class=\"s4-box-highlight\">人生CEO财务系统</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"s4-box\">\n          <div class=\"s4-box-title\"><span class=\"icon\">2</span> 内功心法</div>\n          <div class=\"s4-box-text\">时间管理水池·富爸爸觉醒</div>\n          <div class=\"s4-box-highlight\">中医体质养生</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"s4-box\">\n          <div class=\"s4-box-title\"><span class=\"icon\">3</span> 流量放大</div>\n          <div class=\"s4-box-text\">小红书起号SOP·公众号爆文</div>\n          <div class=\"s4-box-highlight\">个人IP打造</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"s4-box\">\n          <div class=\"s4-box-title\"><span class=\"icon\">4</span> 管道收入</div>\n          <div class=\"s4-box-text\">10大副业项目库·B端实战</div>\n          <div class=\"s4-box-highlight\">投资理财逻辑</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"black-box\">\n        <p>这个时代，拼的是<span class=\"highlight\">多维度竞争力</span></p>\n        <p>你单个维度做到最好不算